{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415674","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415674","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041567401:1":{"text":"我看到你这次对深岩村进行的投资方案了，你看好那边的发展？","source_cn":"我看到你这次对深岩村进行的投资方案了，你看好那边的发展？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37FCF2EE9D37252","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567402:1":{"text":"当然，我实地去考察过，尽管遭遇了一些事故，但总体而言前景依然可观。","source_cn":"当然，我实地去考察过，尽管遭遇了一些事故，但总体而言前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B509AA6CC355FE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567403:1":{"text":"我没想过占据全部的份额，所以秘银商会打算加入吗？","source_cn":"我没想过占据全部的份额，所以秘银商会打算加入吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBFB5EF82029946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567404:1":{"text":"我确实有这个打算，不过不是以秘银商会的名义。","source_cn":"我确实有这个打算，不过不是以秘银商会的名义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDABC0791725ADEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567405:1":{"text":"应该是我以私人名义先行进入，毕竟我还无法完全影响秘银商会的决策。","source_cn":"应该是我以私人名义先行进入，毕竟我还无法完全影响秘银商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1994855F702AA103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title